  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.55 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for Doulas and Lactation Consultants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.55 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for Doulas and Lactation Consultants. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.54, below, shall apply to the voluntary certification of doulas and lactation consultants under RSA 310-A:222:\n\nTable 1002.55 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Voluntary Certification of Doulas and Lactation Support Providers\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nVoluntary certification application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of certification | 2 years | $160\n\nSource. #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
